data: {"id": "3cb2a4872ba1429f-thinking-parallel_evidence-233", "run_id": "3cb2a4872ba1429f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已收到首轮可观测性 baseline 结果。关键事实：\n- **Metrics (Prometheus)**: Pod 处于 CrashLoopBackOff (waiting_reason=1, restarts_total=10, last_terminated_reason=Error)。\n- **Logging (Elasticsearch)**: 获取到崩溃前的 Python 报错日志，显示 `File \"<string>\", line 1, in <module>` 和 `from pathlib import Path; print(Path('/input/app.conf').read_text())`，并在 `~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^` 处报错。这表明容器主进程因读取 `/input/app.conf` 失败而崩溃。\n- **Tracing (DeepFlow/Tempo)**: 无匹配流量数据 (empty)，与容器启动即崩溃、未对外提供服务的情况一致。\n\n接下来需要执行 Kubernetes 层面的关键验证（pla", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789137856842, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

