data: {"id": "3cb2a4872ba1429f-thinking-parallel_evidence-871", "run_id": "3cb2a4872ba1429f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 实体身份与生命周期\n- **实体**: `aiops-case-v09/workload` (UID: `5746c496-b67c-4906-aabb-e71359674305`, Node: `node2`, IP: `172.16.104.20`)。\n- **当前状态**: Pod 处于 `Running` 但容器状态为 `CrashLoopBackOff`，`Ready: False`，重启次数已达 10 次。\n\n### 支持候选原因的证据 (CrashLoopBackOffRuntime)\n1.  **退出原因与代码**:\n    - `kubectl describe` 显示 `Last State: Terminated`，`Exit Code: 1`，`Reason: Error`。\n    - `kubectl previous logs` 与 Elasticsearch 日志确认了崩溃前的最后一次 Python 回溯：\n      ```python\n      Traceback (most recent call last):\n        from ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789137866723, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

